    "method_name": "RAMA Controlled Comparison",
    "description": "Controlled experiment: 3 aggregation methods (standard_mean, rama_full, rama_no_rank) on rel-f1 (driver-position + driver-dnf, 5 seeds) and rel-amazon/item-ltv (5 seeds). Tests whether rank conditioni...",
